] %}
{% include "feature-docs.njk" %}

<p class="mt-10 max-w-2xl text-base/7 text-muted-foreground">Next, see how <a class="font-medium text-primary-ink underline underline-offset-2" href="/features/authentication/">Authentication</a> handles sign-in, protected routes, and identity-service.</p>
